lding upon last season's rewarding difficulties.<br><br></li><li> Battle diverse creatures as you make your way through the treacherous volcanic lands of Papura. </li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964840/extras/50b9a44bfa304c30884bdebac8641d36.avif?t=1748549724\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Your Nemesis.</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Watch as the story develops further into intriguing events in Season 2: Episode 2 of DNA.<br><br></li><li>Search for your great nemesis Terius, in a challenging level of intense difficulty and grit.<br><br></li><li> Fight through a volcanic world full of dangerous creatures native to the lands of Papura... </li></ul></i>",
